Experimental: the disk cache of translated code is kept apart for each experimental build.
MIT, as the file it changes.

The cache is keyed by its format, the host CPU and the options, not by the FEX
that filled it: with FEX options, disk cache on, build 2609-4 ran what 2609-3
had stored and its own change was never translated. The build script writes
the version into Interface/Core/ExperimentalBuild.h, and it goes into the key.

diff --git a/FEXCore/Source/Interface/Core/DiskCache.cpp b/FEXCore/Source/Interface/Core/DiskCache.cpp
